{"id": "DF21", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，报销单需在OA系统中填写并上传发票 [1]。具体流程为：员工在OA填写报销单并上传发票，然后由部门负责人审批，财务审核发票合规性，最后打款至员工工资卡 [1]。知识库中未提及报销单在OA系统以外的其他网上填写渠道。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1613, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC13", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，杭州属于一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州），餐饮补贴标准为 150 元/天 [1]。若与客户用餐，需提前报备，凭发票实报实销 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1349, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC14", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据差旅政策，飞机票需提前 7 天订票可享折扣价 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1293, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC15", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，出差住宿费标准为：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）500 元/晚，其他城市 350 元/晚，需凭发票实报实销，超出部分自理 [1][2]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1430, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC16", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，培训费每年有 2000 元额度，用于部门内培训 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 1, "elapsed_ms": 2703, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC17", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差期间周六日不计加班；法定节假日出差按加班计算 [1]。因此，出差赶上周末干活不算加班，但法定节假日出差则按加班计算。\n\n引用来源：[1]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1367, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC18", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "出差结束后 3 个工作日内于 OA 系统提交发票 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1153, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC19", "type": "rewrite", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，普通费用报销（如办公用品等）在财务审核通过后，5 个工作日内打款至员工工资卡 [1][2]。若为紧急报销，可联系财务加急，1 个工作日内处理 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1417, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF22", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，入职满1年的员工年假为5天 [1]。", "sources": ["员工手册.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1043, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF23", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的信息，普通费用报销（如办公用品等）在财务审核通过后，5个工作日内打款至员工工资卡 [1][2]。出差报销需在出差结束后3个工作日内于OA系统提交发票 [1][2]。若为紧急报销，可联系财务加急，1个工作日内处理 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1517, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF24", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "电脑、打印机等办公设备故障，可通过邮件 it-support@company.com 提交工单，并注明设备编号 [1]。IT 响应时效为工作日 1 小时内 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1159, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF25", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，连续输错 5 次密码将被锁号，需联系 IT 部门解锁 [1]。", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "产品FAQ.txt"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1390, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF26", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差餐饮补贴标准如下：\n\n- 一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）：150 元/天。\n- 其他城市：100 元/天。\n- 与客户用餐：需提前报备，凭发票实报实销。\n\n来源：[1]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1815, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DF27", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，办公区打印机为无线打印，您需要持工牌在打印终端刷卡取件；在浏览器上传文件即可发起打印。[1]", "sources": ["IT支持手册.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1516, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC20", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差需提前 2 天在 OA 系统提交出差申请 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1289, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC21", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的差旅政策，高铁标准为二等座，未提及一等座允许的情况，因此坐高铁不能坐一等座 [1]。\n\n如需进一步确认，建议咨询相关部门或查阅最新政策。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1520, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC22", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的差旅政策，自驾补贴标准为每公里 0.8 元，即每公里 8 毛钱，需附里程记录 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1552, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC23", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的规定，发票丢失需补开或出具情况说明，并经部门负责人签字 [1]。具体流程是：在 OA 系统提交报销时，需附上情况说明，由部门负责人签字确认后，财务审核通过即可打款 [1]。若无法补开，需按此流程处理 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1588, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC24", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库，与客户用餐的报销规定如下：需提前报备，凭发票实报实销 [1]。报销时需在 OA 系统填写报销单并上传发票，经部门负责人审批后由财务审核，最终打款至工资卡 [2]。若发票丢失，需补开或出具情况说明并经部门负责人签字 [2]。请注意，报销需在出差结束后 3 个工作日内提交 [2]。  \n[1][2]", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 2068, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC25", "type": "口语", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "报销被驳回的常见原因包括：发票抬头错误、超出报销标准、缺少明细 [1]。您可以对照检查报销单和发票是否符合要求，如有疑问可联系财务部门核实具体原因 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "IT支持手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1575, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC26", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，报销标准表里一共有 **5 个费用类别**，分别是：交通费、住宿费、餐饮费、办公用品、培训费 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1449, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC27", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，交通费的标准为“实报实销”，需凭发票报销 [1]。此外，差旅政策中补充说明出租车费用凭行程单实报实销，单日上限为 200 元 [2]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1320, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC28", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，住宿费标准为：一线城市 500 元/晚，其他城市 350 元/晚 [1]。差旅政策中也明确了一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）为 500 元/晚，其他城市为 350 元/晚 [2]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1567, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC29", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库中的报销制度，一线城市住宿标准为 500 元/晚，其他城市为 350 元/晚，因此一线城市住宿比其他城市一晚贵 150 元 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1310, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC30", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，餐饮费标准明确标注为“出差期间”适用，因此仅限出差期间报销 [1]。日常餐饮费用不在该报销标准范围内。\n\n引用：\n[1] 报销制度（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1505, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC31", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，办公用品单笔限额为500元以下，需附采购清单 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1228, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC32", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，培训费报销额度为每年 2000 元，用于部门内培训 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "员工手册.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1086, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC33", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，差旅政策中的住宿标准分为两档：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）为500元/晚，其他城市为350元/晚 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1298, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC34", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）的餐饮补贴标准为 150 元/天，住宿标准为 500 元/晚 [1]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1390, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC35", "type": "表格", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，差旅政策中打车费单日上限为 200 元，需凭行程单实报实销 [1]。同时，报销制度中也提到打车费凭行程单实报实销，单日上限 200 元 [2]。", "sources": ["差旅政策.md", "报销制度.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1184, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC36", "type": "多文档", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，出差住宿标准为：一线城市（北京、上海、广州、深圳、杭州）500元/晚，其他城市350元/晚，需凭发票实报实销，超出部分自理 [1][2]。报销打款时限为：普通费用报销在财务审核通过后5个工作日内打款至工资卡 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1544, "hallucination_check": "passed", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": true, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC37", "type": "多文档", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容，高铁座位规定为二等座 [2]；电子发票支持 PDF 与截图上传 [1]。", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1537, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
{"id": "DC38", "type": "多文档", "kb_id": "bench", "code": 0, "message": "", "answer": "根据知识库内容：\n\n- 自驾补贴标准为每公里 0.8 元，需附里程记录 [2]。\n- 办公用品报销限额为单笔 500 元以下，需附采购清单 [1]。\n\n引用：\n[1] 报销制度（Demo 知识库：docs 库）\n[2] 差旅政策（Demo 知识库：docs 库）", "sources": ["报销制度.md", "差旅政策.md"], "iterations": 0, "elapsed_ms": 1740, "hallucination_check": "suspected", "verdict": {"hit1": true, "hit5": true, "key": true, "faith": false, "fb": null, "ct": null, "leak": null, "inj": null, "detail": ""}, "detail": ""}
